{"id":"gamefreak-director-196","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"[GameFreak部长专栏] 第196回","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一记录在晴朗的六本木录音室录制电影音乐，透过现场照片分享明亮舒适的工作环境与设备带来的兴奋。","date":"2011-06-06","publication":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第196回","source":{"title":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第196回","url":"https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/06/index.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/06/index.html","type":"official_blog"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","宝可梦","官方博客"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","翻译资料"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":494,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/entry-196/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193a.jpg","cover_kind":"own","size":[192,256],"archive_type":"gamefreak_director_column","summary":"增田顺一记录在晴朗的六本木录音室录制电影音乐，透过现场照片分享明亮舒适的工作环境与设备带来的兴奋。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"6月4日星期六下午，今天也来到正在录制电影音乐的录音室！\n\n今天的天气也特别好！\n\n在耀眼夺目的太阳旁边，可以看到六本木新城！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n位于大楼二层的录音室！\n\n阳光也照了进来，感觉真舒服！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n看到这样的设备，心情也会跟着雀跃起来呢——。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n真是间让人能够舒舒服服工作的录音室！\n\n那么，回头见！\n\n\n\n\n<details class=\"gf-director-language\"><summary>查看官方英文版</summary>\n\nOn the afternoon of Saturday June 4th,\n\nAgain, I visited recording studio for recording session of\n\nPokémon movie!\n\nToday is very sunny day!\n\nRoppongi Hills(Tokyo) can be seen under the\n\nglittering sun!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/en/193a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nStudio locates on the second floor.\n\nSunshine is pretty comfortable!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/en/193b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nThese instrument make me dazzle.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/en/193c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nIt was cozy and work effective studio!\n\nSee ya!\n\n\n</details>","markdown_ja":"６月４日土曜日午後、今日も映画音楽を収録中のスタジオへ！\n\n今日はとってもいい天気！\n\nギンギンに光る太陽の近くに六本木ヒルズが見えます！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nビルの２Fにあるスタジオ！\n\n日の光も差し込み、気持ちいい！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nこういう機材って、こころ踊りますよねー。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/196/ja/193c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n気持ちよく、仕事ができるスタジオでした！\n\nでは！"}}